$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=z5deutb  LOC_AFTER=?

* The Euler-product factor of Gamma ( set.mm's gamcvg2 ) at m has modulus at most ( m + Re z ) / | z + m | on the strip 0 <_ Re z <_ 1: its numerator has modulus ( ( m + 1 ) / m ) ^ Re z <_ 1 + Re z / m (Bernoulli, z5dbern).

